     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "html",
     "settings": {
      "html": "<section class=\"band--navy\" data-el=\"whitby.smart\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  <div class=\"wrap section split split--center\">\n    <div class=\"reveal\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow mb-s\">Smart by design</p>\n      <h2 class=\"h2 mb-m\">Technology as infrastructure, not decoration.</h2>\n      <p class=\"lead\">Digital access, secure connectivity, facility sensors, automation, data-informed programming, modern signage and emerging technology—subject to privacy, security, design and procurement.</p>\n    </div>\n    <figure class=\"figure figure--16x9 figure--motion wipe\" data-video-scope><div class=\"pmedia\" data-video=\"https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3JOGRzagxf8GC6k15VlPoOU7fkd/hf_20261001_223921_c68c03f6-81f3-4076-b967-afea36a7d32a.mp4\" data-parallax=\"0.08\"><img src=\"{{asset:img/whitby-clay-cutaway.jpg}}\" alt=\"Conceptual clay-model rendering: cutaway interior of a proposed sports dome showing a long-span arched roof, abstracted field zones, mezzanine learning rooms and a media studio volume as untextured masses. Not an existing facility.\" width=\"1344\" height=\"752\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n      <figcaption class=\"caption-bar\">Conceptual Rendering — Not an Existing Facility</figcaption>\n    </figure>\n  </div>\n</section>"
